  "ai_language_tip": "Speak clear, polite standard Croatian (hr); Serbian/Bosnian are understood but use Croatian vocabulary; English is good on the coast, in Zagreb and tourism, weaker at GP offices and inland trades; Italian/German help in Istria and Dalmatia resorts.",
  "english_ok": "often — Widely spoken in Zagreb and the coast, especially in tourism and among younger staff; less in public clinics, offices and rural inland.",
  "politeness": "Formal 'Vi' with strangers, 'gospodine/gospođo'; open with 'Dobar dan' and say for whom you call; close with 'Hvala, doviđenja'.",
  "name_tip": "Surname first in bookings ('na ime Horvat'); Croatian surnames mostly do not change by gender; spell foreign names letter by letter.",
  "phone_tip": "Mobile 09x + 6–7 digits (e.g. 091 234 5678), Zagreb landline 01 + 7 digits, +385; WhatsApp/Viber on the same mobile is common.",
  "time_tip": "TRAP: 'pola osam' = 7:30 (half to eight), while 'sedam i pol' is also 7:30; 'četvrt do osam' = 7:45; always read back in 24h.",
  "number_tip": "Group counts use collective forms ('troje', 'četvero' for mixed groups); 'dvije osobe' (feminine); read phone numbers in groups.",
  "avoid_calling": "Avoid lunch 12:00–14:00 at small offices, dinner peak 19:00–21:30 (later on the coast in summer), calls after 20:00, and Sundays for shops and offices.",
  "closed_days": "Since July 2023 shops are closed on Sundays except 16 Sundays a year each shop chooses (often summer on the coast) and exempt places (petrol stations, stations, hotels); all 14 public holidays close shops (e.g. 6 January, Easter Monday, Corpus Christi, 30 May, 22 June, 5 and 15 August, 1 and 18 November, 25–26 December).",
  "booking_channels": "Phone, WhatsApp, Viber and Instagram for restaurants and salons; Google and some online booking pages; Wolt, Glovo and Bolt Food for delivery; private polyclinics book by phone or web, public care via the GP and e-Građani.",
  "voice_menu": "Operators (HT, A1, Telemach), banks, HZZO, Hrvatska pošta and couriers use keypad IVR; small venues answer on a mobile.",
  "callback_habits": "Small businesses confirm by SMS, WhatsApp or Viber; tourist accommodation confirms by email; clinics often SMS a day before.",
